msgstr "如果新的逻辑搜索语法导致意外结果，请启用旧的搜索行为。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:256
msgid "Tag search mode"
msgstr "标签搜索模式"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:258
msgid "In strict mode, tags must be prefixed with a hash character (#)."
msgstr "在严格模式下，标签必须以井号（#）为前缀。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:259
msgid "In lax mode, tags can also be found without the hash character."
msgstr "在宽松模式下，不加井号也能搜索到标签。"

#: bookmarks/templates/settings/general.html:260
msgid ""
"Without the hash character, tags are harder to distinguish from ordinary "
"search terms, so unrelated results may also match."
msgstr "不加井号时，标签更难与普通搜索词区分，可能匹配到无关结果。"

